<title>ESTONIA: KULMHOONE SHARES TO START TRADE ON BOURSE.</title>
<headline>KULMHOONE SHARES TO START TRADE ON BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Estonian ice cream producer Tallinna Kulmhoone will be traded on the free market of the Tallinn stock exchange from Friday, June 27, a bourse official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
